{
"id": "eng-zh-001",
"translation": "The subgrade compaction should reach 95%."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-002",
  "translation": "Set up temporary traffic signs at K12+340."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-003",
  "translation": "The backfill of the abutment shall be compacted in layers, with each layer not exceeding 200 mm in thickness."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-004",
  "translation": "If rainfall exceeds 10 mm, deck concrete placement shall be suspended and completed areas covered."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-005",
  "translation": "Before construction of the substructure of the bridge, the contractor shall verify the axis, bearing seat elevation, embedded item positions, and the stability of temporary supports, and submit the survey records for the Engineer's approval."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-006",
  "translation": "The manhole cover of the manhole should be flush with the road surface."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-007",
  "translation": "The pipeline gradient is 0.8%."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-008",
"translation": "The sewer pipe shall be DN600 ductile iron pipe, and the joint shall undergo a water-tightness test."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-009",
  "translation": "The interior of the inspection well shall be repaired with polymer mortar, and the repair thickness shall not be less than 15 mm."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-010",
  "translation": "Before backfilling, the water, debris, and loose soil within the manhole must be cleared, the invert elevation must be confirmed to match the design value, and the work must be signed off by the quality engineer."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-011",
"translation": "The MTBM cutterhead rotates at 6 rpm."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-012",
  "translation": "The jacking thrust shall not exceed 1200 kN."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-013",
  "translation": "During MTBM advancement, attitude, earth pressure, and mud flow rate should be monitored continuously."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-014",
  "translation": "When the torque of the cutter head abnormally increases, advance should be stopped, and operation can be resumed only after checking the cutters and the spoil-removal system."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-015",
  "translation": "The launch shaft and reception shaft for pipe jacking shall complete structural acceptance before equipment enters the shaft; the guide rail centerline, reaction wall bearing capacity, slurry pipeline, and emergency stop circuit must be recorded in the equipment launch inspection form."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-016",
"translation": "The elevation of the re-measurement point is 42.315 m."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-017",
"translation": "Measurement records shall use the coordinate system EPSG:32643."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-018",
  "translation": "The design invert elevation at station K08+125 is 38.640 m."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-019",
  "translation": "When the measurement error exceeds ±5 mm, the instrument must be re-setup and an independent check performed."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-020",
  "translation": "Before setting out, the surveyor shall verify the coordinates and elevations based on the approved control point list, mark the center stake and offset for each well location, and file the original observation values, calculation sheets, and verification signatures together."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-022",
"translation": "The reinforcement cover thickness is 40 mm."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-024",
  "translation": "Check the template dimensions, rebar spacing, embedded sleeve, and concrete slump 120±20 mm before pouring."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-025",
  "translation": "Test specimens shall be retained and marked with date, location, and batch for each pour; if the 28 d compressive strength is lower than the design value, the contractor must submit a cause analysis and strengthening proposal, and shall not remove the supports without authorization."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-026",
"translation": "The excavation depth is 2.4 m."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-027",
"translation": "The foundation bearing capacity shall not be less than 150 kPa."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-028",
  "translation": "The soft soil layer should be replaced with graded crushed stone and compacted in layers."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-029",
  "translation": "If water seepage or disturbed soil occurs at the formation level, stop excavation immediately and notify the engineer to confirm the treatment method."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-030",
  "translation": "The design of trench support shall be combined with groundwater level, soil layer parameters, and data on foundations of adjacent buildings; any dewatering, anchoring, or soil reinforcement measures that have not been approved shall not be implemented."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-031",
  "translation": "Must wear a safety helmet."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-032",
  "translation": "The test results shall be recorded in the inspection lot form."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-033",
  "translation": "The construction area shall be equipped with continuous, stable, and visible hoarding."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-034",
  "translation": "Unauthorized personnel shall not enter the lifting radius. Before lifting operations, check the rigging, signaling, and ground bearing capacity."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-035",
  "translation": "The quality plan shall specify material entry inspection, process witness points, nonconforming product isolation, corrective action closure, and record retention periods, and clearly define the responsibility boundaries between the contractor, subcontractor, and engineer."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-037",
  "translation": "The submittal status is pending approval."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-038",
  "translation": "The contractor shall submit the material submittal 14 days prior to construction."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-039",
  "translation": "If the drawings and site conditions are inconsistent, the Contractor must submit an RFI and obtain a written instruction before continuing construction."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-040",
  "translation": "Any impact on progress or cost shall be notified within the notice period, accompanied by the affected activities, quantity calculations, relevant clauses, and verifiable contemporaneous records; failure to notify within the prescribed time shall not be deemed as automatically obtaining an extension of time or cost compensation ⟦PH_0001⟧ ⟦PH_0002⟧."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-041",
  "translation": "The control panel power is 400 V."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-042",
  "translation": "SCADA should display the pump station level."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-043",
  "translation": "The rated power of the fan is 7.5 kW, and the ingress-protection rating is IP55."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-044",
  "translation": "Before starting the deodorization system, confirm that the ductwork has no leaks, activated carbon has been loaded, and the differential-pressure switch alarm function is normal."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-045",
  "translation": "Electrical and SCADA commissioning shall be completed point by point in accordance with the approved point list, covering remote/local switching, fault alarms, interlocked shutdown, power restoration, and historical trends; any unacknowledged alarms shall not be marked as passed before handover."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-046",
  "translation": "Please confirm receipt of this letter."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-047",
  "translation": "The meeting schedule is on 2026-09-15."
}

{
"id": "eng-zh-048",
"translation": "Please return comments within three working days."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-049",
  "translation": "Unless approved in writing by the Engineer, the Contractor shall not interpret this letter as a variation instruction."
}

{
  "id": "eng-zh-050",
  "translation": "This letter records only the current on-site facts and does not exempt any party from its obligations under the contract regarding notification, mitigation, and data preservation; if new interfaces or security risks are discovered in subsequent investigations, a supplementary explanation shall be submitted immediately and the action list updated."
}

{
"id": "eng-en-001",
"translation": "路基压实度应达到 95%。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-002",
  "translation": "在 K12+340 处安装临时交通标志。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-003",
  "translation": "分层回填桥台后的背填料，每层厚度不超过 200 mm。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-004",
  "translation": "如果降雨量超过 10 mm，暂停桥面混凝土浇筑并覆盖已完成区域。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-005",
  "translation": "在建造桥梁下部结构之前，承包商应核实支座垫石高程、预埋件位置及临时支撑的稳定性，并将测量记录提交工程师审批。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-006",
  "translation": "井盖应与路面齐平。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-007",
"translation": "管道坡度为 0.8%。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-008",
  "translation": "使用 DN600 球墨铸铁管作为污水管，并对接头进行闭水试验。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-009",
  "translation": "用聚合物砂浆修复检查井内壁；修复厚度不得小于 15 mm。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-010",
  "translation": "回填前，清除检查井内的积水、杂物和松散土壤，确认管底高程与设计值一致，并取得质量工程师签署的放行文件。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-011",
"translation": "MTBM 刀盘转速为 6 rpm。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-012",
"translation": "顶进推力不得超过 1200 kN。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-013",
"translation": "在 MTBM 掘进过程中持续监测姿态、土压和泥浆流量。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-014",
  "translation": "当刀盘扭矩异常升高时，应停止顶进，并在检查刀头和排渣系统后再恢复顶进。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-015",
  "translation": "MTBM 始发井和接收井在设备下井前必须通过结构验收；导轨中心线、后背墙承载力、浆液管路和紧急停机回路应记录在设备下井检查表中。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-016",
  "translation": "复测点高程为 42.315 m。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-017",
  "translation": "测量记录应使用坐标系 EPSG:32643。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-018",
  "translation": "桩号 K08+125 处的设计管底高程为 38.640 m。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-019",
  "translation": "如果测量误差超过±5 mm，请重新设置仪器并进行独立复核。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-020",
  "translation": "放样前，测量员应核对已批准的控制点列表中的坐标和高程，标记每个检查井的中心桩和偏距，并将原始观测数据、计算表和检查签名一并归档。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-021",
"translation": "混凝土强度等级为C30。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-022",
"translation": "钢筋保护层为 40 mm。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-023",
  "translation": "钢筋搭接长度应按设计图纸执行，未经批准不得缩短。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-024",
"translation": "放置前，检查模板尺寸、钢筋间距、预埋套管以及坍落度为 120±20 mm 的混凝土。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-025",
  "translation": "对每个浇筑部位，应制作标记有日期、位置和批次的试件；若 28 d 抗压强度低于设计值，承包商应提交原因分析及加固方案，且未经批准不得拆除支撑。"
}

{
"id": "eng-en-026",
"translation": "开挖深度为 2.4 m。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-027",
  "translation": "地基承载力不应小于 150 kPa。"
}

{
  "id": "eng-en-028",
  "translation": "将软土层换填为级配碎石，并分层压实。"
}
